        <div class="cav">Get the number right</div>
        <h1>How to Calculate Your GPA, <em>Done Right</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">A plain guide to calculating GPA the way schools actually do it: the credit-weighted formula, weighted versus unweighted, how to combine terms into a cumulative GPA, and how to plan the grades you need. The Best Answer Hub GPA Calculator does all of it free, across 8 scales, with no signup.</p>
        <div class="byline"><span><b>Best Answer Hub</b></span><span>~10 min read</span><span>Step-by-step</span><span>No signup</span></div>
